Fatal Powered Haulage Accident<br>
<br><br>
April 11, 2006
<br><br>
1845 Texas Stone Products, Inc.<br>
Texas Stone Products, Inc.<br>
Lometa, Lampasas County, Texas<br>
Mine I.D. No. 41-03518

<br><br>
Investigators
<br><br>
